 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "NC State・種: こぼれ種でよく殖え、手に負えないほど広がりうる・weedy。Gaißmayer: 走出枝で強く広がるので場所をよく選ぶ。stauden.de・種: wuchernd。商品が種そのものなので E とした（mixing は「強い」で、米国中西部の指定雑草の話は根拠にしていない）。E でなければ MBG「夏に葉が傷んだら強く切り戻す」で C。機械の C から変更",
  "management_type_quote": "It freely self-seeds and can spread out of control.",
  "management_type_by_matching": "C 夏前切戻型",
  "heat_west_only": "中",
  "muggy_west_only": null,
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[NC State/種] If plants dry out, the leaves become scorched, but the plant can be cut back hard to generate new growth.\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: North-facing or West-facing or East-facing or South-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[こぼれ種 2／NC State・種] It freely self-seeds and can spread out of control.\n[地下茎 2／stauden.de・種] ausläufertreibend",
  "mixing_evidence": "[stauden.de・種] Wuchsstärke: wuchernd\n[NC State・種] Some Midwestern states consider this plant a noxious weed and do not allow it to be grown or transplanted where there is any danger of it spreading.",
